QUDT
----

data/qudt/kinds.json is generated from the QUDT quantity kinds and units
vocabularies of QUDT release 3.5.2 (data/qudt/source.json names the archive
and its SHA-256). It holds each kept kind's local name, English label, URI,
dimension vector and the UCUM codes of its applicable units.

  QUDT is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
  International License (CC BY 4.0),
  <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/>. Attribution: QUDT.org.

pubunit changes the data: it restates dimension vectors in UCUM's base
units, and leaves out kinds and units UCUM cannot express (listed in
data/qudt/REPORT.md).


